<title>EU:  EP LEGAL AFFAIRS COMMITTEE AGENDA - MAY 13.</title>
<headline>EP LEGAL AFFAIRS COMMITTEE AGENDA - MAY 13.</headline>
<text>
<p>Committee on Legal Affairs and Citizens' Rights</p>
<p>[[ Tuesday 13 May 1997 ]]</p>
<p>MEETING ROOM NO. WILL BE INDICATED ON THE SCREENS</p>
<p>1. Adoption of draft agenda</p>
<p>1.1 In the presence of the Council and Commission</p>
<p>2. The legal protection of biotechnological inventions (T04629) (96/017) COD95350 COM(95)0661 C4-0063/96 + JURI Fond R ROTHLEY Willi. (PSE) (PE218.021 )</p>
<p>- Consideration of compromise amendments</p>
<p>3. Any other business</p>
<p>4. Date of next meeting (PE/VII/OJ/11-97 )</p>
<p>4.1 Deadline for texts for translation before the next meeting (reminder): - Monday, 28 April 1997 END OF DOCUMENT.</p>
</text>
